{'symbol': 'CZR', 'date': '2021-09-21 12:00:00', 'title': 'CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT AND NOBU HOSPITALITY STRENGTHEN PARTNERSHIP WITH THREE NEW LOCATIONS ACROSS THE US', 'text': "LAS VEGAS, SEPT. 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT, INC. AND NOBU HOSPITALITY – THE GLOBAL LIFESTYLE BRAND FOUNDED BY NOBU MATSUHISA, ROBERT DE NIRO AND MEIR TEPER – TODAY ANNOUNCED THE EXPANSION OF ITS LONGSTANDING PARTNERSHIP WITH TWO NEW NOBU HOTELS AND RESTAURANTS AT HARRAH'S NEW ORLEANS AND CAESARS ATLANTIC CITY, A NOBU RESTAURANT AT PARIS LAS VEGAS AND A REFRESH OF THE FIRST NOBU HOTEL AT CAESARS PALACE LAS VEGAS."}